{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is currently under development. All content, including visuals and gameplay, is subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overflow: Number Crunch is a roguelike puzzle game based on calculations. Complete the quota within the time limit.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/9e7752ce0e98dbade25787ebe5d7b02a.poster.avif?t=1758247755\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/9e7752ce0e98dbade25787ebe5d7b02a.webm?t=1758247755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/9e7752ce0e98dbade25787ebe5d7b02a.mp4?t=1758247755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you create numbers that match the requirements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a calculator to manipulate the given numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the roguelike system, you can gradually power up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage takes about 20 to 30 minutes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/8e8a8122085b2ecaf6fa0cf89c7f7d90.poster.avif?t=1758247755\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/8e8a8122085b2ecaf6fa0cf89c7f7d90.webm?t=1758247755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/8e8a8122085b2ecaf6fa0cf89c7f7d90.mp4?t=1758247755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic controls use only the mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply click on the numbered chips and their destinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character transports the chips.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/a1d098f2157f75aed21b2bd97284ef3d.avif?t=1758247755\" width=320 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/extras/a7ac2a48aba7a04b041b19f71c889bfd.avif?t=1758247755\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the quirky cast who assist you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They work hard\u2014please treat them well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage consists of five to ten waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a limited amount of time to carry over between waves within a stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you submit a chip, a certain amount of time is added.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If time runs out, it's game over.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016410?t=1758247755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016410?t=1758247755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016410/829b0b3a628a32bd8c2c543a4ec92835a3a885a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758247755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40164